# providers

index: **0–9** (зарезервировано)

## Назначение

React providers: инициализация SDK, context value, side effects (useEffect).

## Структура feature

```
{feature}/
├── index.ts                 ← thin export + namespace
├── provider.tsx
├── provider.interface.ts
├── provider.module.css      ← optional
├── context/
│   ├── context.ts
│   └── context.interface.ts
└── {sub}/                   ← optional UI (ToastList)
```

## index.ts

```ts
export const AlertsProvider = (props) => createElement(BaseAlertsProvider, props);

export namespace AlertsProvider {
  export type Props = AlertsProviderProps;
}
```

## provider.tsx

- `'use client'` если browser APIs / effects
- Inject service: `alertsService.manager(manager)` в useEffect + cleanup
- Context.Provider с value object (methods + state)

## Связь с hooks

Hook потребляет context → `src/hooks/{feature}/hook.ts`
**Не** export hook из provider index — отдельный path.

## Связь с services

Imperative API в `src/services/{feature}/` — provider wiring, service logic.

## CSS

- `@layer index-0` или index из providers range
- Module рядом с provider.tsx

## Эталоны

- `src/providers/alerts/` — provider + list sub-component + service
- External SDK → `src/integrations/{vendor}/…/provider/` (не сюда)
- Component: `src/components/actions/toggle/component/.partials/providers/`
- Form: `src/components/forms/fieldset/component/providers/`

## 4-file context

### Когда

- Shared state между compound sub-parts (toggle)
- App-level API через context (alerts)
- Feature-scoped form state (fieldset)

### 4 файла (минимум)

```
providers/
├── provider.tsx
├── provider.interface.ts
└── context/
    ├── context.ts
    └── context.interface.ts
```

+ `index.ts` на уровне feature для публичного export provider.

### context.ts

```ts
import { createContext } from 'react';
import { FeatureContextProps } from './context.interface';

export const FeatureContext = createContext<FeatureContextProps | null>(null);
```

### context.interface.ts

- Shape value: methods, state, refs
- **Не** import React components

### provider.interface.ts

- Props provider: `children`, config, optional callbacks

### provider.tsx

```tsx
export function FeatureProvider({ children, ...config }: FeatureProviderProps) {
  const value = useMemo(() => ({ /* … */ }), [deps]);

  return (
    <FeatureContext.Provider value={value}>
      {children}
    </FeatureContext.Provider>
  );
}
```

### Consumer hook

Отдельный файл `hooks/hook.ts` или `component/.partials/hooks/hook.ts`:

```ts
export function useFeature(): UseFeatureProps {
  const context = useContext(FeatureContext);
  if (!context) {
    throw new Error('useFeature must be used within <FeatureProvider>');
  }
  return context;
}
```

### Расположение

| Scope | Path |
| ----- | ---- |
| App-level | `src/providers/{feature}/` |
| External SDK | `src/integrations/{vendor}/…/provider/` |
| Component-local | `component/.partials/providers/` |
| Form feature | `forms/.../component/providers/` |

### Export

- Provider — через feature `index.ts` + namespace
- Context — **не** export наружу (internal)
- Hook — через `src/hooks/{feature}/index.ts`
